  "text": "### Waiting Customer Management  \n**If Wait > 5 Minutes:**\n- Apologize: \"Sorry for the wait, we'll be with you shortly\"\n- Offer refreshment: \"Can I get you a coffee or water?\"\n- Keep updated: \"About 3 more minutes\"  \n**If Wait > 15 Minutes:**\n- Escalate to manager\n- Offer to schedule appointment\n- Take contact info for callback",
